The '''Cathedral''' is one of two floors following the {{s|Womb}} / {{s|Utero}} / {{s|Scarred Womb}}, the other being {{s|Sheol}}. After defeating {{e|Mom's Heart}}, depending on Isaac's deal chance, an {{r|Angel Room}} may spawn which will only contain a beam of light leading upwards to the Cathedral. Other methods to enter the deal room such as {{P|Joker}} or {{e|Red Chest}}s will work too. It's also possible to enter Cathedral via the beam of light in {{r|I AM ERROR}} Rooms. Unlocking and defeating {{e|It Lives!}} will always spawn a beam of light leading to the Cathedral, as well as a trapdoor leading to Sheol.

The Cathedral has only one floor, featuring mostly undead and/or holy enemies, and the boss is always {{e|Isaac}}.

{{e|Blue Fire Place}}s are far more common in this floor than normally.

